WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.577
An analytics layer should be discoverable.

00:00:02.577 --> 00:00:07.237
This query lists views and materialized views in the analytics schema.

00:00:07.237 --> 00:00:13.942
Object catalogs help teams understand what reusable interfaces already exist before creating duplicates.

00:00:13.942 --> 00:00:17.242
They also support documentation and governance.

00:00:17.242 --> 00:00:21.067
Choose the smallest reusable object that matches the need.

00:00:21.067 --> 00:00:29.167
A CTE is local to one query, a view centralizes live logic, and a materialized view persists a snapshot.

00:00:29.167 --> 00:00:34.042
Promote logic into shared objects when it is stable, reused, and worth governing as part of the analytical

00:00:34.042 --> 00:00:35.760
architecture.
